#: docs/delivery/support.md:51
msgid ""
"六个 UART 的 `dma-tx` 共用官方 HAL 有限 TX 和分离 LL IRQ RX，支持 byte／event 接收。六个实例也分别支持 "
"`rx-dma-idle`、`rx-dma-continuous`、`dma-duplex` 和 `dma-duplex-"
"continuous`，复用同一接收、双缓冲和借用排空算法。固定 TX／RX 路由为： USART1 DMA2 stream7／2 "
"channel4；USART2 DMA1 stream6／5 channel4；USART3 DMA1 stream3／1 channel4；UART4"
" DMA1 stream4／2 channel4；UART5 DMA1 stream7／0 channel4；USART6 DMA2 stream6／1"
" channel5。只读 C 硬件事实表同时用于 冷态准入、标志位和 IRQ 选择，不增加可变实例字段。TC 与 DMA 完成分别观察，撤回 "
"失败继续保留借用，W1C 只清理所选 stream。六路也支持独立 9N1 的 `irq-words` 和由调用者提供存储的 `irq-"
"blocks`；9 位数据不经过 byte 接口。其他可选 UART 模式、替代引脚和 DMA 路线必须另外接入。"
msgstr ""
"All six UARTs share official HAL finite TX and disjoint LL IRQ byte/event RX"
" in `dma-tx` mode. Each also supports `rx-dma-idle`, `rx-dma-continuous`, "
"`dma-duplex` and `dma-duplex-continuous`, reusing the same receive, double-"
"buffer and borrow-drain algorithms. The fixed TX/RX routes are: USART1 DMA2 "
"stream7/2 channel4; USART2 DMA1 stream6/5 channel4; USART3 DMA1 stream3/1 "
"channel4; UART4 DMA1 stream4/2 channel4; UART5 DMA1 stream7/0 channel4; "
"USART6 DMA2 stream6/1 channel5. One readonly C hardware table supplies cold "
"admission, status and IRQ selection without extra mutable instance fields. "
"Wire TC and DMA completion are observed separately. Failed withdrawal "
"retains borrows, and W1C clears only the selected stream. All six also "
"support independent 9N1 `irq-words` and caller-backed `irq-blocks`. Nine-bit"
" data never passes through the byte interface. Other UART protocols, "
"alternate pads and DMA routes require separate integration."

#: ../../../../docs/delivery/support.md:57
msgid ""
"ADC1／2 通道对应 PA0--7、PB0--1、PC0--5。ADC3 在 VE 开放 PA0--3 的通道 0--3 和 PC0--3 的通道 "
"10--13；ZG 另有 PF6--10 的通道 4--8、PF3 的通道 9 和 PF4／5 的通道 14／15。序列可以重新排序或重复同一输入，最多"
" 16 ranks，重复 输入的 sample time 必须一致；每个使用的引脚都须有明确 Board route。 注入组和同步多 ADC "
"模式尚未接入。16-rank 与三独立实例参考装配见 `tests/contracts/adc_external_assembly/`，不授予真实 "
"PCB 或物理采样资格。"
msgstr ""
"ADC1/2 channels map to PA0--7, PB0--1 and PC0--5. On VE, ADC3 exposes "
"channels 0--3 on PA0--3 and channels 10--13 on PC0--3; ZG additionally "
"exposes channels 4--8 on PF6--10, channel 9 on PF3, and channels 14/15 on "
"PF4/5. Sequences may reorder or repeat an input up to 16 ranks; repeated "
"inputs must use the same sample time, and each used pin requires an explicit"
" Board route. Injected groups and synchronized multi-ADC modes remain "
"unsupported. The 16-rank and three-independent-instance references in "
"`tests/contracts/adc_external_assembly/` grant no PCB or physical sampling "
"qualification."

#: ../../../../docs/delivery/support.md:64
msgid ""
"三个 ADC 的 `resolution_bits` 均可选择 6／8／10／12，默认 12。各转换器的 poll、 有限和连续 DMA "
"共用该静态选择，转换周期与触发速率准入随之变化。DMA 仍使用 halfword，样本仍是右对齐的 `uint16_t` "
"原始计数；分辨率选择不建立模拟精度或实际吞吐资格。"
msgstr ""
"All three ADCs select `resolution_bits` from 6/8/10/12, defaulting to 12. "
"Each converter uses that static choice for polling, finite and continuous "
"DMA; conversion costs and trigger-rate admission change with it. DMA still "
"transfers halfwords of right-aligned `uint16_t` raw counts. Resolution "
"selection establishes neither analogue accuracy nor measured throughput."

#: ../../../../docs/delivery/support.md:68
msgid ""
"共享 ADCCLK 固定为 PCLK2／4，即 21 MHz。冷态改分频前先取得数字接口观察责任， 确认所有 ADC 已关闭，再撤回本次临时 "
"gate；匹配分频时不写 CCR。准备与其他 ADC 启动必须串行，不支持并发热接入或动态调频。软件采样停止回读失败保留设备清理责任， "
"平台关闭成功前禁止再次采样，但返回后不保留调用者的样本或 count。"
msgstr ""
"Shared ADCCLK is fixed at PCLK2/4, or 21 MHz. Before changing the divider "
"during cold setup, acquire the digital interfaces for observation, confirm "
"every ADC is off and withdraw the temporarily added gates. A matching "
"divider causes no CCR write. Preparation must be serialized against other "
"ADC starts; concurrent hot attachment and dynamic frequency changes are "
"unsupported. A failed software-sampling stop readback retains device cleanup"
" and prevents new sampling until platform close succeeds. Caller samples and"
" count are not retained after return."

#: docs/delivery/support.md:55
msgid ""
"DMA buffer 必须位于所选可达域，CCM 不可用于该 DMA。连续 producer 不覆盖已借用 块，缺替换存储时停止并报告 "
"loss；模型或静态预算不证明任意负载下无丢失。 取消、超时和停止失败继续保留 buffer 与恢复责任，直到真实排空并发布 SETTLED。"
msgstr ""
"DMA buffers must reside in the selected reachable domain; CCM is unavailable"
" to this DMA. A continuous producer does not overwrite borrowed blocks. It "
"stops and reports loss when replacement storage is unavailable; models or "
"static budgets prove no loss-free behavior under arbitrary loads. Cancel, "
"timeout and failed stop retain buffer and recovery duties until actual drain"
" and SETTLED publication."

msgid ""
"DAC 由一个 controller owner 独占，按所选通道取得 PA4／PA5；与 ADC 或 SPI 的 引脚冲突必须拒绝。公共 CPU "
"写入始终接收未移位原始码，`u12-left` 由 C 编码， 数字 DOR 始终为右对齐 12 位，`u8` 观察值为输入码乘 16。TIM6／7 "
"触发只开放 独占的 84 MHz 固定时钟源，API 的 1 MHz 上限是数字配置政策，不是模拟性能保证； 实际分频可查询。noise "
"是确定性波形，不能用于熵源。stop 保持所声明空闲码， 完整 Platform stop 才禁用 DAC "
"并恢复原引脚字段；失败保留责任且可重试。两种密度的 `tests/contracts/dac_assembly/` 只提供软件参考，不代表 PCB "
"接线、负载、精度或 模拟 settling 资格。外部共享触发与物理验收仍未完成。"
msgstr ""
"One controller owner exclusively owns DAC and acquires PA4/PA5 for the "
"selected channels; pin conflicts with ADC or SPI must be rejected. Public "
"CPU writes always accept unshifted raw codes, and C encodes `u12-left`. "
"Digital DOR observations always use right-aligned 12-bit units; `u8` "
"observations equal the input code multiplied by 16. TIM6/7 triggering only "
"admits an exclusive fixed 84 MHz timer source. The API limit of 1 MHz is a "
"digital configuration policy, not an analog performance guarantee; the "
"actual divider is queryable. Noise is a deterministic waveform, not an "
"entropy source. Stop holds the declared idle code. Complete Platform stop "
"disables DAC and restores the original pin fields; failures retain "
"responsibility and can be retried. The two-density "
"`tests/contracts/dac_assembly/` fixtures are software references only, "
"without PCB wiring, load, accuracy or analog settling qualification. "
"External shared triggering and physical acceptance remain incomplete."

msgid ""
"DAC 的 `trigger-dma`／`trigger-dma-circular` 是可选静态 TX 分面，共用同一个 controller "
"ID；CPU 模式不预留 DMA 状态。调用方提供最多 65535 个编码帧，明确 字节数、对齐和 DMA 可读域；左对齐与双通道 lane "
"已由调用方编码，保留位须为零。 通道 1／双通道使用 DMA1 stream5 channel7，单独通道 2 使用 stream6 channel7，"
" 同时独占所选 TIM6／7、stream IRQ 与 TIM6_DAC IRQ。IRQ 只锁存事实和可选 wake， 调用方推进 "
"service；不会隐式建立 task、queue 或复制缓冲区。"
msgstr ""
"DAC `trigger-dma`/`trigger-dma-circular` modes use an optional static TX "
"facet with the same controller ID; CPU modes reserve no DMA state. The "
"caller supplies at most 65535 encoded frames with explicit byte extent, "
"alignment and DMA-readable memory domains. Left alignment and dual-channel "
"lanes are already encoded by the caller; reserved bits must be zero. Channel"
" 1/dual mode uses DMA1 stream5 channel7; channel 2 alone uses stream6 "
"channel7. They also exclusively own the selected TIM6/7, stream IRQ and "
"TIM6_DAC IRQ. IRQs only latch facts and an optional wake hint; the caller "
"progresses service. No task, queue or copy buffer is implicitly created."

msgid ""
"有限 DMA 成功包含最后数字锁存；首触发输出 idle，尾部可能短暂停 timer、插入 间隔或重复末码，不承诺恰好 N "
"次模拟转换。循环模式持续借用至取消、超时或故障后 完成排空。SETTLED 之前 request 与帧保持有效且不可改写；无法排空时保留 "
"QUARANTINED，next_service 返回 NEVER，由调用方明确恢复和重试。欠载状态需显式 stop 与 W1C 回读恢复。软件模型和 "
"ARM 链接不授予物理输出性能资格。"
msgstr ""
"Finite DMA success includes the final digital latch. The first trigger "
"outputs idle; the tail may briefly pause the timer, insert an interval or "
"repeat the last code. It does not promise exactly N analog conversions. "
"Circular mode retains the loan until complete drain after cancellation, "
"timeout or failure. The request and frames remain live and immutable until "
"SETTLED. Failed drain retains QUARANTINED; next_service returns NEVER, and "
"the caller explicitly recovers and retries. Underrun recovery requires "
"explicit stop and W1C readback. Software models and ARM linkage do not "
"establish physical output performance qualification."

msgid ""
"静态装配指定唯一 CRC controller owner；factory 只查询既有接口。 `crc32-words` 使用多项式 "
"0x04C11DB7、 初值 0xffffffff、MSB 优先、不反射且无 final XOR。输入为 32 位数值字，长度以字 "
"计；不隐式拼装或补齐字节流。空序列返回初值。每 16 字和最终读回检查绝对 deadline； 失败不改输出、不保留借用，下一次计算重新 "
"reset。输入／输出与 state、CRC 和其 时钟控制区隔离；关闭只撤回新增 gate，失败保持可重试 receipt，CRC_IDR 保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Static assembly assigns one CRC controller owner; factory lookup returns the"
" existing interface. `crc32-words` uses polynomial 0x04C11DB7, initial state"
" 0xffffffff, MSB first, no reflection and no final XOR. Input is a sequence "
"of numeric 32-bit words, with length in words; byte streams are not "
"implicitly packed or padded. An empty sequence returns the initial state. "
"The absolute deadline is checked every 16 words and after the final "
"readback. Failure leaves output unchanged and retains no loan; the next "
"calculation resets afresh. Input/output storage is separate from state, CRC "
"and its clock controls. Close withdraws only the added gate and retains a "
"retryable receipt on failure. CRC_IDR remains unchanged."

msgid ""
"`nx_chip_info_read` 无需启动外设，直接读取实际 UID、device／revision ID 和 16 位 Flash "
"容量，不补用配置值、不开时钟、不分配常驻状态。身份数据不代替硅片 启动准入，也不证明完整订货号／封装或认证秘密。Native 显式返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED； 模型与 ARM 链接仍不能证明物理身份、吞吐或实板功能。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_chip_info_read` requires no peripheral startup. It directly observes the"
" actual UID, device/revision IDs and 16-bit Flash capacity, without "
"configured fallback values, clock enabling or persistent state. Identity "
"data does not replace silicon startup admission or establish an exact "
"ordering code, package or authentication secret. Native explicitly returns "
"UNSUPPORTED. Models and ARM linkage do not establish physical identity, "
"throughput or board functionality."

#: docs/delivery/support.md:59
msgid "选择、证据与保留依赖"
msgstr "Selection, evidence and retained dependencies"

#: docs/delivery/support.md:61
msgid ""
"[派生矩阵](capabilities.md)关联声明模式、受审路线、Board、装配与实际生产 ops。 "
"查询通过只建立配置一致性；模型、ARM、SDK、软件候选和物理 station 记录分别验证。 当前物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`，未知"
" PCB、跳线、电源与波形仍保持未知。"
msgstr ""
"The [derived matrix](capabilities.md) relates declared modes, reviewed "
"routes, Boards, assemblies and actual production ops. A successful query "
"establishes only configuration consistency. Model, ARM, SDK, software-"
"candidate and physical-station records are verified separately. Physical HIL"
" is currently `not_executed`; unknown PCB, jumpers, power and waveforms "
"remain unknown."

#: docs/delivery/support.md:65
msgid ""
"所有 vendor、子模块和许可证保留；未选 SDK 不进入生产支持或默认构建闭包。 退出的其他 MCU 适配仅保留历史追溯，原始范围见 "
"[重构前固定源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18)。 "
"本次重构不能继承旧候选、软件计数或实板结果。"
msgstr ""
"All vendors, submodules and licenses are retained. Unselected SDKs do not "
"enter production support or the default build closure. Other retired MCU "
"integrations remain historical references at the [fixed pre-refactor "
"source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18). This refactor "
"cannot inherit old candidates, software counts or physical-board results."

#: docs/delivery/support.md
msgid ""
"SPI1／2／3 共用轮询和有限全双工 DMA 实现，均可选择 8／16 位增强事务；I2C1／2／3 共用 polling、IRQ 和 DMA 的 C"
" 时序计算，`max_hz` 默认 100000，名义范围为 5129–400000 Hz。CCR 向上取整；Fast-mode 使用 2:1 duty"
" 与 300 ns TRISE 公式。 RM0090 §27.6.8 要求特定 PCLK 条件才能达到 400 kHz；固定 42 MHz 下， "
"`max_hz=400000` 选择 CCR=36，名义约 388.9 kHz。时钟容差、上拉和总线电容仍须实板验证。 异步恢复保留取得的时序与 "
"wake；请求、通知发布者或 DMA 尚未退出时返回 BUSY， 不会先复位硬件。SPI endpoint 的 `lsb_first` 默认 "
"false，可显式选择 true， 覆盖三个控制器的普通 byte face、8／16 位增强 polling 与 DMA；只在空闲后修改 "
"硬件位序，不反转或复制 buffer。I2S／TI 和固定 MSB 的 BMP280 不使用该选择。 SPI3 的 AF6 路线是 PC10／11／12"
" 或 PB3／4／5；I2C3 是 PA8 SCL 与 PC9 SDA AF4，恢复检查两条真实 输入。SPI2 使用 DMA1 stream4 "
"TX／stream3 RX channel0，SPI3 使用 stream5 TX／ stream0 RX channel0；I2C3 使用 "
"stream4 TX／stream2 RX channel3。共享物理 stream 时配置拒绝，不自动替换路线。增强 SPI DMA "
"事务的每段完成都保持同一 CS，取消和 停止失败保留整条请求与借用，直到所选引擎、线端和 CS 均已撤回。"
msgstr ""
"SPI1/2/3 share polling and finite full-duplex DMA implementations and each "
"supports enhanced 8/16-bit transactions. I2C1/2/3 share C timing calculation"
" for polling, IRQ and DMA; max_hz defaults to 100000, with a nominal range "
"of 5129–400000 Hz. CCR rounds upward; Fast-mode uses 2:1 duty and the 300 ns"
" TRISE formula. RM0090 §27.6.8 requires a particular PCLK condition to reach"
" 400 kHz; at fixed 42 MHz, max_hz=400000 selects CCR=36, nominally about "
"388.9 kHz. Clock tolerance, pull-ups and bus capacitance still require "
"hardware validation. Asynchronous recovery preserves the acquired timing and"
" wake sink. It returns BUSY before resetting hardware while a request, "
"notification publisher or DMA is still live. The SPI endpoint option "
"lsb_first defaults to false and may explicitly be true. It covers ordinary "
"byte faces and enhanced 8/16-bit polling and DMA on all three controllers. "
"Hardware bit order changes only while idle, without reversing or copying "
"buffers. This choice does not apply to I2S/TI or the fixed-MSB BMP280 "
"driver. SPI3 AF6 routes use PC10/11/12 or PB3/4/5. I2C3 uses PA8 SCL and PC9"
" SDA AF4, and recovery observes both real inputs. SPI2 uses DMA1 stream4 "
"TX/stream3 RX channel0; SPI3 uses stream5 TX/stream0 RX channel0; I2C3 uses "
"stream4 TX/stream2 RX channel3. Configuration rejects shared physical "
"streams without silently replacing routes. Enhanced SPI DMA keeps one CS "
"interval across segment completions. Failed cancellation or stop retains the"
" whole request and borrows until the selected engines, wire and CS are all "
"withdrawn."

#: docs/delivery/support.md
msgid ""
"ADC1 使用 DMA2 stream4 channel0，ADC2 使用 stream2 channel1，ADC3 使用 stream1 "
"channel2；有限和连续模式均按所选 lane 解释并清除标志。TIM3 是独占触发源， 不同 ADC 的 DMA stream "
"不冲突也不能同时取得同一 TIM3。软件参考装配见 "
"`tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*tertiary*.toml`，覆盖 VE／ZG 和裸机／ "
"FreeRTOS；它们不授权实际 Board 接线。"
msgstr ""
"ADC1 uses DMA2 stream4 channel0, ADC2 stream2 channel1, and ADC3 stream1 "
"channel2. Finite and continuous modes interpret and clear only their "
"selected lane flags. TIM3 is an exclusive trigger source: distinct ADC DMA "
"streams do not authorize simultaneous TIM3 ownership. Software reference "
"assemblies in `tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*tertiary*.toml` "
"cover VE/ZG and baremetal/FreeRTOS without authorizing actual Board wiring."

msgid "PWM"
msgstr "PWM"

msgid ""
"TIM3／TIM5 的 CH1–4 中各显式选择一路；固定 84 MHz timer clock 与 PSC／ARR；TIM3 周期 "
"1–65535，TIM5 周期 1–4294967295；无隐式共享时基"
msgstr ""
"Select one of CH1–4 on each TIM3/TIM5 controller explicitly; fixed 84 MHz "
"timer clock and PSC/ARR; TIM3 periods 1–65535 and TIM5 periods 1–4294967295;"
" no implicit timebase sharing"

msgid ""
"ADC1 的内部通道 16／17／18 分别返回温度、VREFINT、VBAT／2 的原始计数。 `adc1-internal` route 不取得 "
"GPIO；四种现有采样模式共用静态序列，内部输入固定选择 `sample_times=7` 的 480-cycle "
"acquisition。温度、电压换算和校准由应用负责， `reference_mv` 仍是名义值。冷态拒绝接管已启用的所需模拟路径，仅撤回本次取得的 "
"TSVREFE／VBATE；失败保留 clock 与清理责任。1 MHz 时间域的启动等待包含取整裕量： 外部输入 4 μs，含内部输入 11 "
"μs。软件参考见 `tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*adc-"
"internal*.toml`；不建立物理采样资格。"
msgstr ""
"ADC1 internal channels 16/17/18 return raw counts for temperature, VREFINT "
"and VBAT/2 respectively. The `adc1-internal` route acquires no GPIO; all "
"four existing sampling modes share static sequences, with internal inputs "
"restricted to `sample_times=7` for a 480-cycle acquisition. Applications own"
" temperature/voltage conversion and calibration; `reference_mv` remains "
"nominal. Cold preparation rejects already-enabled required analog paths and "
"releases only the acquired TSVREFE/VBATE paths; failed cleanup retains "
"clocks and responsibility. Startup waits include quantization margin in the "
"1 MHz time domain: 4 us for external inputs and 11 us for sequences "
"containing internal inputs. Software references are in "
"`tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*adc-internal*.toml`; they "
"establish no physical sampling qualification."

msgid "普通 PWM 共用一套 C 实现；以下按通道顺序列出已审路线，仍须由 Board 显式授权。"
msgstr ""
"General PWM shares one C implementation. The reviewed routes below list pads"
" in channel order and still require explicit Board authorization."

msgid ""
"period 表示完整周期，ARR=period−1；TIM5 上限为 UINT32_MAX，其他已审 timer 为 65535，duty 可达 "
"period，保留 CCR 表达 100% 的空间。set 只暂存 duty，在 update event 生效；周期与 PSC "
"保持固定。每个控制器由一路 owner 独占，不隐式共享时基或 同步多个 timer。TIM3 与 ADC trigger、TIM4 与 capture"
" 互斥；现有 TIM1 advanced PWM 仍保守独占共享 vector 的 TIM9。冷态 C 校验精确 "
"timer、pad、channel、分频和 位宽，启钟／撤回失败保留所选 APB gate 的清理责任；已有 GPIO owner 不被覆盖。 "
"`tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*pwm-family*.toml` 同时链接九个独立实例， "
"不授权 PCB 接线或实际输出时序。"
msgstr ""
"The period is a complete cycle, with ARR=period-1. The upper bound is "
"UINT32_MAX for TIM5 and 65535 for the other reviewed timers; duty may equal "
"period, reserving CCR representation for 100% output. Set stages duty until "
"an update event; period and PSC stay fixed. Each controller has one "
"exclusive channel owner, with no implicit time-base sharing or cross-timer "
"synchronization. TIM3 conflicts with ADC triggering and TIM4 with capture; "
"the existing TIM1 advanced PWM conservatively reserves TIM9 on its shared "
"vector. Cold C validates the exact timer, pad, channel, divider and width. "
"Failed clock acquisition/withdrawal retains the selected APB gate cleanup "
"responsibility, and existing GPIO owners are preserved. The "
"`tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*pwm-family*.toml` fixtures link "
"nine independent instances; they establish no PCB wiring or physical output "
"timing qualification."

