msgid "Encoder"
msgstr "Encoder"

msgid ""
"TIM3／4／5 独占 TI1／TI2 原始正交计数；x2 TI1、x2 TI2、x4 TI12，独立输入反相与 4-bit filter；无 "
"IRQ／DMA／累计位置策略"
msgstr ""
"Exclusive TIM3/4/5 TI1/TI2 raw quadrature counting; x2 TI1, x2 TI2 or x4 "
"TI12, independent input inversion and 4-bit filters; no IRQ/DMA or "
"accumulated position policy"

msgid ""
"Encoder 复用现有公共接口与 typed factory：TIM3 为 PA6／PA7、TIM4 为 PB6／PB7、 TIM5 为 "
"PA0／PA1，均为 AF2。计数宽度分别为 16／16／32 bits，filter clock 固定 84 MHz；`counting` 选择 "
"`x2-ti1`／`x2-ti2`／`x4-ti12`，两路 filter code 为 0–15。 每个 encoder 独占整个 "
"timer，与同一控制器的 PWM／capture 互斥。"
msgstr ""
"Encoder reuses the existing public interface and typed factory: TIM3 uses "
"PA6/PA7, TIM4 PB6/PB7, and TIM5 PA0/PA1, all on AF2. Counter widths are "
"16/16/32 bits with a fixed 84 MHz filter clock. Select `counting` from "
"`x2-ti1`/`x2-ti2`/`x4-ti12`, with filter codes 0–15 on each input. Each "
"encoder owns the whole timer and conflicts with PWM/capture on that "
"controller."

msgid ""
"准备成功时 counter 仍关闭；应用显式 start。stop 保留原始 modulo position， 完整 close "
"先证明输入／counter／DMA 请求和中断源已停止，再撤回本次 clock；失败保留 静态 descriptor 与清理责任。read "
"的时间是软件观察时刻，不代表某条边沿；不能恢复 漏采的整圈，方向历史、速度、机械零点和累计位置由产品决定。代码不建立 ring、 任务、IRQ 或 "
"DMA。示例为 `tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*encoders*.toml`； filter "
"code 不构成实测抗噪或物理边沿速率保证。"
msgstr ""
"Successful preparation leaves the counter disabled; applications explicitly "
"start it. Stop preserves raw modulo position. Full close proves "
"input/counter/DMA-request/interrupt-source withdrawal before removing the "
"acquired clock; failure retains the static descriptor and cleanup "
"responsibility. Read timestamps are software observations rather than edge "
"timestamps. Missed complete wraps cannot be reconstructed; products own "
"direction history, speed, mechanical zero and accumulated position. The code"
" creates no ring, task, IRQ or DMA. Examples are "
"`tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*encoders*.toml`; filter codes "
"establish no measured noise rejection or physical edge-rate guarantee."
